    "content": "All 22 checklist items have been tested and recorded (complete: true).\n\n## Summary\n\n**18 PASS / 4 FAIL**\n\nThe bookkeeping application (LedgerFlow) performs well for core functionality: transaction CRUD, dashboard summaries, search, multi-criteria filtering, category management, tax-related marking, and the annual tax summary with print all work correctly and update reactively within the session.\n\n**Failures found:**\n- **CS-23** – Transactions can be created with no category selected; the blank category is silently accepted instead of being blocked/flagged.\n- **CS-24** – Deleting a category that has assigned transactions is not blocked and doesn't prompt reassignment; affected transactions are left with a blank category (breaking category integrity and skewing tax/category totals).\n- **CS-15** – An invalid date range filter (From date later than To date) is silently accepted and just yields \"No transactions found,\" with no explanation that the range itself is invalid.\n- **CT-22** – The Dashboard's Income vs Expenses chart Y-axis rounds to the nearest $1k, so most tick values (even representing real distinct amounts like $150–$450) render as indistinguishable \"$0k\" labels."
